SUMMARY:Line Dancing at First Fridays
DESCRIPTION:Ready to kick up your boots and hit the dance floor?⁠\n⁠\nJoin us on First Fridays\, July 3\, for a night of line dancing lessons and open dance. Whether you’re a seasoned dancer or stepping onto the floor for the first time\, they’ll guide you through every move. ⁠ \n⏰ Doors are at 4. Lessons start at 4:15! \n👢 Lessons and DJ by Grapevine Dance \n🎟️ $20 admission—cash or card at the door. \n🕺 Kids 12 and under free. All skill levels welcome\, no partner required. \n🍹 We’ll have a cash bar with cocktails\, mocktails\, and other beverages! \nSee you on the dance floor!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/line-dancing-at-first-fridays/
LOCATION:Hall of the Above\, 199 Petaluma Blvd N.\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Kids and Family,Music
GEO:38.235604;-122.641187
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Hall of the Above 199 Petaluma Blvd N. Petaluma CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=199 Petaluma Blvd N.:geo:-122.641187,38.235604
END:VEVENT
